PianoWifi is new code for UniXNU-piano (BSD-2-Clause-Patent, LICENSE). Levels 1 (read-only survey), 2 (power), 3 (the PCIe0 link),
4 (the firmware over MHI), 5 (the IPC router's channels, QRTR and the WLAN firmware's QMI service) and 6 (the copy engine, the
host transport, the firmware's message interface and a passive scan), with the macOS side of level 6 in PianoWifiEthernet.cpp.
