PianoWifiEthernet.cpp (the macOS side of level 6) is new code for this repository, with the same shape as this repository's
package/PianoNullEthernet/PianoNullEthernet.cpp (whose own provenance is that package's UPSTREAM): an IOEthernetController with
no device behind it — the medium published, the interface attached and marked built in, every frame dropped, the BSD wait
disabled — re-expressed here with its link left **down**, the scan list of level 6 copied onto it, and an address of this
driver's own. PianoNullEthernet is not modified, and no kext from outside this repository is linked (the native kext rule,
tooling/k27/check-native-kexts.py).
